Hello everybody,<br>Hoping to do something nice,<br>I want to share with you the codeplug I created for the OpenGD77 complete with all the Italian repeaters separated by zones of all networks (BM, IT-DMR, DMR +, DMR-ITALIA) and all the Italian TGs and clusters.<br>Just open it with the CPS Community and enter your Call and DMR-ID, and upload it to the radio.<br>I hope you can enjoy it.<br>Greetings to the whole OpenGD77 community and a special thanks to Roger clark who allows us to do all this.<br>73 by IU4LEG Fabio<br><br>the link to download the codeplug is the following ( from my Gdrive):<br><br><a href="https://drive.google.com/open?id=17cjVFP_5-0IgwOvvIqRDJRYxVjNauIR6" class="postlink">https://drive.google.com/open?id=17cjVF ... YxVjNauIR6</a><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=189">IU4LEG</a> — Sat Nov 30, 2019 4:32 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
